  With BER identically zero the recovered bits ARE the transmitted
  bits, so carrier crosstalk is exactly zero by construction and the
  matrix can only report its own floor.  The measurement is a check on
  the estimator, not on the carrier; it earns its place by failing
  loudly if a slot ever rotates.

